{"type":"text","timestamp":1788349439825,"sessionID":"ses_f9e12b54bffe5CzyalueGVMpfG","part":{"id":"prt_061eec07c001hHsEGlEva32uDz","messageID":"msg_061ee9f0c001IzUtpZf1n4F8P5","sessionID":"ses_f9e12b54bffe5CzyalueGVMpfG","type":"text","text":"Now performing the systematic static review across all categories.\n\n**Module shape check:**\n- `import math` (L24) ✓ \n- `import torch` (L27) ✓\n- `import asc` (L29) ✓\n- `import asc2` (L30) ✓\n- `from ._pyasc_runtime import ensure_npu_platform` (L32) ✓\n- Two `@asc2.jit` kernels (L44, L64) ✓\n- Public callable `gelu` matching schema (L88) ✓\n- Wrapper: `ensure_npu_platform()` → contig → `empty_like` → launch → return ✓\n\n","time":{"start":1788349431932,"end":1788349439822}}}
