{"type":"text","timestamp":1788349512078,"sessionID":"ses_f9e12b54bffe5CzyalueGVMpfG","part":{"id":"prt_061efe178001nlXvoRG0VMBjTN","messageID":"msg_061ef7844001GoLtD5QnHQe7cM","sessionID":"ses_f9e12b54bffe5CzyalueGVMpfG","type":"text","text":"**All 20 case routes — PASS**\n\n- Cases 1,2,3,7,9,11,13,15,16,18,20 → erf mode, TILE=2048 (all >147456 elems) ✓\n- Cases 4,5,6,8,10,12,14,17,19 → tanh mode, TILE=1024 ✓\n- All use grid-stride + `real_shape` tails → handles any flatten-size and any rank ✓\n- `size == 0` handled at L97 ✓\n- `approximate` validation via assert at L91 ✓\n\n","time":{"start":1788349505912,"end":1788349512076}}}
