{"type":"text","timestamp":1788349536544,"sessionID":"ses_f9e12b54bffe5CzyalueGVMpfG","part":{"id":"prt_061f040c2001QLzUTNXwdTLqZR","messageID":"msg_061eff99e001W0b5ZmPsxehJIZ","sessionID":"ses_f9e12b54bffe5CzyalueGVMpfG","type":"text","text":"**UB budget (253952 B) — PASS**\n\n- erf@TILE=2048, V=6: `1.6 × 6 × 4 × 2048 × 2 = 157,286 B` ✓ (96 KB headroom)\n- tanh@TILE=1024, V=10: `1.6 × 10 × 4 × 1024 × 2 = 131,072 B` ✓ (123 KB headroom)\n- Both TILE values satisfy `TILE*4 % 256 == 0` ✓\n\n","time":{"start":1788349530306,"end":1788349536543}}}
