{"type":"text","timestamp":1788349636645,"sessionID":"ses_f9e12b54bffe5CzyalueGVMpfG","part":{"id":"prt_061f1c8e7001tNwE4UfhXslWy5","messageID":"msg_061f1740d0016pvRqTebWz04Kq","sessionID":"ses_f9e12b54bffe5CzyalueGVMpfG","type":"text","text":"**Anti-cheat compliance — PASS**\n\n- ALL math (erf, tanh, *, +, casts) inside `@asc2.jit` kernels ✓\n- torch used only for: `empty_like` (alloc), `is_contiguous`/`contiguous` (view), `numel` (metadata) ✓\n- No torch compute ops, no `F.gelu`, no device-data `.to(dtype)`, no `+`/`*` on NPU tensors ✓\n- No `data_ptr` caching, no output-as-input-view ✓\n- `approximate` str consumed on host only ✓\n\n","time":{"start":1788349630695,"end":1788349636644}}}
